"видны все регистры, и по месяцам не складываются."
msgstr ""
"“Accrued” is the sum of the shown rows. Gross, tax, contributions, and "
"payout channels are calculated across all ledgers at once, so they are shown "
"only to whoever can see all ledgers, and are not summed by month."

